# Scenario 2: Rescuing an at-risk renewal

Simulation with a fictional 120-seat law firm, using Cal.com as the real product. Not paid client work.

Simulated result: health score 21.8 to 72.3 and renewal agreed.

## What is in this folder
- spreadsheets/: health score model and risk playbook
- documents/: outreach kit
- images/: HubSpot, workflow and ticket screenshots